","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Misako is Yuusuke's father's new wife. Her previous husband died three years prior to the beginning of the game's story. The relationship between Misako and her new husband is nothing more than a marriage of convenience for Yuusuke's father's company and there is no real affection between them. A yearning for something that she couldn't express has freed Misako's forbidden desires, as her relationship with her new step-son started to grow more and more complex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Geo's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59422"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b62f104f88822b9051f7f0ec3ea758c3c5424588f8f63e679178cd1dbd2766d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/9061891e79b7805db973b0c156908a2b0e30fabf424347290c3fa5959a67c7da.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白井 綾乃","creatorId":"vndb:s665","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s665","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s665","name":"あらい しずか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1448","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59423","characterName":"八神 しいな","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59423"},"originalCharacterName":"八神 しいな","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shiina is the daughter of Misako and her previous husband. She have moved in to Yuusuke's home together with Misako after her mother's new marriage. She is a kind step-sister and a pure girl who has never known mistrust. Because she has nobody to look up to as a fatherly figure in her life, she constantly seeks an older male who can act that role for her. Somewhat inevitably, she'll develop a girlish kind of crush on her new step-brother. Depending on Yuusuke's choices, their relationship could grow into something more than just that of a simple brother and sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Geo's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59423"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d707024694bae0ddaf452f112968ff50ff15f7168b5e66f41614c8a51b3be6f5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/0092de0aa1a5a6eb44084e6d00660abc20d4fdf4fad0e7c645a5d777d5be9fcb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"AKIRA (seiyuu)","creatorId":"vndb:s4555","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4555","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4555","name":"AKIRA (seiyuu)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1449","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59424","characterName":"篠原 未央","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59424"},"originalCharacterName":"篠原 未央","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuusuke's cousin Mio is a high school student that goes to the same school as him. She is a honor student who enjoys being a class representative. She's got a calm, relaxed type of personality. She likes putting up a facade of being a \"good girl\" while in secret she has a hidden side of hers that loves sex. Although Mio considers Yuusuke a mere plaything, she'll feel disturbed by the prospect of losing him from her grasp once Misako moves in to Yuusuke's residence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Geo's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59424"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a3889a35719702c5f6a35dad56b2963b52648d75ccb43bd7254a4e6eafac18c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13f4e822d8cb18a912e40f0e3a859b930afcab3ec9ae7fe937234622d4ec703d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北都 南","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:1447","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60747","characterName":"八神 祐介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60747"},"originalCharacterName":"八神 祐介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuusuke's a college student that lived alone ever since his father and mother divorced but his life will change once his father remarries a beautiful widowed woman and he suddenly gets a step-mother. Accompanying his step-mother is also her daughter, Yuusuke's new step-sister. With the introduction of new family members, Yagami residence perhaps will not be as lonely as before. But with new residents in the house, something else burried deep in Yuusuke's subconsciousness will also awake. The past traumas of his biological mother's adultery will resurface once again and will come back to haunt Yuusuke. Will his new 'mother' be able to soothe his anxiety or will she just simply become a victim of his displaced anger?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Geo's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60747"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8d8de22d5a17d3baac4d7d9a287f726552ed4bfc192c1945d718c44d752242dd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a735ab1da99e69fd2bea4b6ab4b181abf2a52a24e8546340d4ffe1911f2f883f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c91472","characterName":"Yusuke Yagami's Mother","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c91472"},"originalCharacterName":"Yusuke Yagami's Mother","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yusuke's biological mother and the maternal aunt of Mio, a very beautiful and attractive woman with voluptous large breasts. Being a nymphomaniac, she had sex with her lover everyday, cheating on her husband Eizo while her son Yusuke was at school, once she traumatized her son Yusuke who witnessed her adultery by accident. Eventually Eizo found out about her adultery and thus they divorced."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91472"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/544916b4822b2d1b22723293ed0671c35fa5753d176ac661f3c1152595a4dba4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b5e21cb07692b82be5920e1e1b386d4925057e57ff8c8e5e52e8cde4a99a41bd.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:91","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:91","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:91","name":"Guilty","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"ambiguous-shared-work-re